{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 39, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To Japan, thou dost travel, and for thy journey's course, a Shakespearean itinerary I shall craft.\n\nFirst, in Tokyo, thou shalt arrive, where thy eyes shall behold the might of Shard Tower, and where the neon lights dance in the night. There, in the heart of Ginza, dost thou dine at a sushi bar, where the artistry of the chef shall be thy feast.\n\nNext, to Kyoto, where the ancient spirits whisper in the temples and gardens, dost thou proceed. The Golden Pavilion, Kinkaku-ji, doth gleam under the sun, and in the bamboo groves of Arashiyama, dost thou find solace.\n\nThen, to Osaka, where the culinary delights shall tantalize thy taste buds. In Dotonbori, dost thou partake in street food, and at Universal Studios, dost thou seek adventure.\n\nAfter, to Hiroshima, where thou shalt pay respects at the Peace Memorial Park, and where the history of a world at war doth echo.\n\nFinally, to Hakone, where the mountains embrace thee, and where the hot springs shall soothe thy weary bones.\n\nThus, thy journey in Japan, a tapestry woven with ancient culture and modern wonders, shall be complete.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.5660529136657715}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.072114109992981}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.7624446153640747}, {"token": " thou", "logprob": -1.0368716716766357}, {"token": " d", "logprob": -1.590287685394287}, {"token": "ost", "logprob": -0.19644416868686676}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -2.789968490600586}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.10636213421821594}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -1.02623450756073}, {"token": " for", "logprob": -2.7004191875457764}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.3174495995044708}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -0.07262572646141052}, {"token": "'s", "logprob": -0.6622781753540039}, {"token": " course", "logprob": -1.0510361194610596}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0475283153355